  "body": "IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENT, CONTACT US RIGHT AWAY!\r\n\r\nWe are offering a 10% cash discount on 5 selected sections (valid for unconditional contracts signed in June only).\r\nWe offer Builder's Terms for up to 9 months.\r\nOur business partner offers Builder's Terms financing of section purchase up to an 80%.\r\nOur business partner offers Construction Loans up to an 80% .\r\n\r\n29 Whenuateitei Crescent offers a 451sqm (approx.) section with broad appeal. The proportions are well suited to a variety of contemporary building concepts while remaining easy to manage.\r\nStanmore Bay Beach, local shopping, dining options, and essential amenities are all conveniently nearby. Families will appreciate access to schools and recreational facilities, while the upcoming Penlink connection will provide faster access to SH1 and beyond.\r\nA smart section opportunity that blends lifestyle convenience with long-term growth potential.\r\nGet in touch for further details and take the next step with confidence.",
